 "title": "Treasurer | Stanton County",
 "text": "Treasurer | Stanton County\nSkip to main content\nStanton County\nToggle navigation\nToggle Navigation\nStanton County\n-->\nMain menu\nAbout\nCounty Offices\nBoard\nBudgets\nCalendar\nNotices\nServices\n{ % if site_slogan %} { { site_slogan }} { % endif %}\n-->\nTreasurer\nDuties:\nTo collect all revenues for the County\nTo bill and collect all real estate and personal taxes in the County\nRegister all motor vehicles with tax situs in the county (Titles and Registrations)\nTo disburse collections to the proper political subdivisions\nBoat Registration\nSnowmobile Registration\nPayments by Credit Card are available with a fee.\nPlease call (402)439-2223 with any questions.\n___________________________________\nDriver's License Testing and Renewals are no longer\navailable at the Stanton County Courthouse\nNew DMV Regional Facility is located at:\n2209 N 13th St, Norfolk NE\n(402) 402-4005\nOpen Monday through Friday 8:00AM - 4:00PM\nLimited walk-in assistance is available\nSchedule an Appointment - Schedule\nAppointments are required for drive tests\n___________________________________\nCounty Treasurer\nSandra Zoubek\n804 Ivy St\nPO Box 385\nStanton NE 68779\n(402) 439-2223\nFax: (402) 439-2299\nE-mail: treasurer@stantoncountyne.gov\nInformational Materials Available:\nCDL Books\nBoating Books\nSpecialty License Plate Applications\nNotices:\nUSPS Postmark Press Release\nServices and links provided by the Treasurer:\nFAQ\nReal Estate and Personal Taxes OnLine\nDriver's License Examining Division\nDriver & Vehicle Records Divsion\nNebraska Department Motor Vehicles\nVehicle Titling Information\nRegistration Renewal online - Department Motor Vehicles\nMotorboat Title Division\nBoat Registrations (online renewal only)\nUnclaimed Property Information\nUnclaimed Property - Claim Form\nVitalChek (Birth, Death, Marriage and Divorce Certificates)\nInformation\n804 Ivy St\nPO Box 347\nStanton, NE 68779\n(402) 439-2222\nContact Us\nUseful Links\nOnline Services\nSheriff’s Office\nCounty Attorney\nCounty Treasurer\nCounty Clerk\nCalendar\nPublic Records\nElection Results\n© State of Nebraska\nPowered by Tyler Technologies\nNebraska.gov | Policies | Login",
